<p><b>战术</b></p>

<p>毒蛇群对高级pc来说应该只是个小麻烦，但真正的威胁是六臂蛇魔。祖弗格斯是Seghulerak的战友，当Seghulerak在圣坛里时，六臂蛇魔就担任典狱长。</p>

<p>她耐心地等待着，藏在房间中央的憎恶蛇魔的虚幻雕像里。她能用她的真视能力看破这一幻象。当PC们进入时，她试图召唤1d4 hezrous。然后她喝了一瓶+4树肤药水。在第三轮中，她使用"投影术"将自己的影像放置在一个角落的阳台上，然后使用她的类法术的能力来骚扰PC，布置"剑刃护壁"并使用心灵遥控迫使pc通过屏障并离开阳台。当被迫近战时，她使用她的加速魔杖并激活狂野之舞。然后，在凌空而行的帮助下，她利用自己的高速和能力，在移动时进行全回合攻击并奋战至死。</p>

<p><b>区域特征</b></p>

<p><b>Lighting: </b>This area is dark.</p>

<p><b>Balconies/Bridges: </b>The balconies have no railings; a fall off one of them causes 3d6 points of damage and immediately exposes the victim to the carpet of snakes.</p>

<p><b>Illusory Statue</b>: The statue of Sertrous in the middle of the room is a <i>permanent image </i>(CL 20th). The statue is large enough for a Large or smaller creature to hide within.</p>

<p><b>Prison Pits: </b>An adamantine grate seals the top of each pit. The grate cannot be opened; prisoners are placed in the pits using <i>teleport </i>spells. The shaft of each pit drops 20 feet</p>

<p>and is warded with a <i>forbiddance </i>spell (CL 15th, Will DC 28). At the base, each shaft opens into a cubical cell; most cells are 7 feet square, but three are larger (15 feet square) for larger prisoners. Feel free to stock these prison cells with prominent NPCs that have been captured by the Vanguard in the campaign.</p>

